TI  - Predicting the need for aged care services at the small area level: The CAREMOD spatial microsimulation model
AU  - Lymer, Sharyn
AU  - Brown, Laurie
AU  - Harding, Ann
AU  - Yap, Mandy
VL  - 2
IS  - 2
PY  - 2009
DA  - 2009/12/31
